    Medical practices lose revenue to no-shows and forgotten payments.

    ## Solution

    Automated WhatsApp receptionist integrated with Google Calendar.

    ## Features

    - Appointment reminders
    - Rescheduling via WhatsApp
    - Payment reminders with Yape
    - Google Calendar sync
